  "generated_description": "<div class=\"mountain-description prose prose-stone max-w-none\">\n  <p>At 11,824 feet, <strong>Middle Nebo Peak</strong> is a summit in Utah. It has roughly 5,433 feet of topographic prominence. The Middle Nebo Peak Trail is a 2.2-mile hike with about 1,811 feet of elevation gain. Nearby peaks include South Nebo Peak, Mount Nebo and Mount Timpanogos. Trail data is sourced from OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL); verify current conditions with the official land manager before you go.</p>\n</div>",
